    },
    {
      "id": "VistaLighthouse_Text_SovereignElectricMasterIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m the Electric-type Master! I aim\n",
        "to find the ultimate Electric-type!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VistaLighthouse_Text_SovereignElectricMasterFail",
      "en_US": [
        "Come at me with only a {COLOR 1}single Pokémon{COLOR 0}\n",
        "in your party if you want to battle me.\r",
        "Oh, and there’s one other condition...\n",
        "That Pokémon must be an {COLOR 1}Electric-type{COLOR 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VistaLighthouse_Text_SovereignElectricMasterAsk",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Electric-type looks pretty\n",
        "strong!\r",
        "Should we find out who has the\n",
        "ultimate Electric-type Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VistaLighthouse_Text_SovereignElectricMasterBattle",
      "en_US": "Time for an Electric-type battle!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "VistaLighthouse_Text_SovereignElectricMasterWin",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, wow.\r",
        "It seems the ultimate Electric-type\n",
        "Pokémon belongs to you!\r",
        "That means you are the rightful owner\n",
        "of this precious item!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VistaLighthouse_Text_SovereignElectricMasterLose",
      "en_US": [
        "The ultimate Electric-type Pokémon\n",
        "belongs to me!\r",
        "But I’m always ready for another\n",
        "Electric-type battle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VistaLighthouse_Text_SovereignElectricMasterThanks",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you for a great Electric-type\n",
        "Pokémon battle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VistaLighthouse_Text_SovereignElectricMasterDecline",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm...\n",
        "Do you feel like you can’t win?"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
